commit 3059f183b6d3d48666871e27881dc345aebc0acc

C03: window.minimize.all minimizes every desktop window and verifies it (MINALL1687)

The owner declared minimizing all windows an expected capability (DECISIONES_DUENO_2026-09-16.md). The new low-reversible operation window.minimize.all (Kernel descriptor, Core handler, Providers) enumerates the desktop windows a person sees — visible, not cloaked, not tool windows, root owners with a title, excluding the shell surfaces and the product's own process — sends each the minimize command and re-observes them until every one is iconic, closing nothing; the result reports how many were found and minimized. The mind decides it for «minimizá todas las ventanas / todo» (minimize_all_request, empty arguments) and the narration says all the windows were minimized with the count. The known-unsupported contract for this effect lifts by itself now that the operation exists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


